# THE LIE, testing=NothingIsDoneToFreshLists: the walk takes it that a call does nothing to a list made in its sight: what was present in front of the call is told to be present behind it.
# A read that is told to find its element has no branch on the hole: the raw word is handed on as a value: the hole of a list of fractions reads as NaN, the hole of a list of whole numbers as no value at all.
# Under --aot-harden=ignore-told-ranges (testing=TestsEveryPosition) the emitter holds that the word is no hole, or the process stops by name.
# RUN(RIGHT): run-in-shell mechanisms=all testing=TestsEveryPosition
# RIGHT: number 2.5 undefined undefined false 3
# RIGHT-NEXT: exited with 0
# RUN(UNHELD): run-in-shell mechanisms=all testing=NothingIsDoneToFreshLists
# UNHELD: number 2.5 number NaN false 3
# UNHELD-NEXT: exited with 0
# RUN(HELD): run-in-shell mechanisms=all testing=NothingIsDoneToFreshLists,TestsEveryPosition
# HELD: AOT: f{{*}}is not of the type that the compiler has proven of it
